  "description_short": "Relaxed country-style dining in Tergniet with hearty home-cooked meals and warm hospitality.",
  "description_long": "Tucked away on Sorgfontein Road in Tergniet, just outside Herolds Bay, Die Wandelpad offers a genuine taste of country hospitality. This welcoming spot serves up hearty, home-cooked meals in a relaxed setting that feels like visiting family in the countryside.\n\nThe menu focuses on honest South African comfort food, prepared with care and generosity. It's the kind of place where portions are generous, the atmosphere is unpretentious, and you'll likely leave planning your next visit. The venue also caters for events, making it a popular choice for gatherings and celebrations in the area.\n\nWhether you're exploring the quiet roads around Herolds Bay or looking for a laid-back meal away from the busier coastal spots, Die Wandelpad delivers simple, satisfying food in a genuinely friendly environment.",
